<title>UK: Rank buys back 500,000 shares at 333p/shr.</title>
<headline>Rank buys back 500,000 shares at 333p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British leisure company Rank Group Plc said on Monday it had bought back 500,000 ordinary shares for cancellation at 333 pence each.</p>
<p>Rank said it bought the stock from BZW Securities Ltd and NatWest Securities Ltd.</p>
<p>Earlier this month, the group said it would start to buy back up to 83.6 million shares or 10 percent of its issued share capital.</p>
<p>It purchased 41.428 million shares -- 4.9 percent -- at 345 pence on August 8 and 500,000 shares at 344 pence on August 11.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
